("In regulated industries like pharma, the FDA mandates strict compliance with 21 CFR Part 11. Traditional paper records suffer from transcription) Tj
T* (errors, illegible signatures, and falsification risks. I built PharmaFlow 21: a full-stack paperless document workflow that ingests PDFs, CSVs, and) Tj
T* (JSON files, automatically extracts and structures tabular data, runs an AI scanner to correct spelling typos and casing anomalies, enforces strict) Tj
T* (segregation of duties so authors cannot review or approve their own submissions, stamps tamper-proof electronic signatures with SHA-256) Tj
T* (cryptographic hashes, and automatically renders and archives certified PDFs into an immutable audit vault.") Tj
