(FDA 21 CFR Part 11 regulates electronic records and electronic signatures. PharmaFlow 21 satisfies it through:) Tj
T* (\(1\) Re-authentication password challenges for signatures \(§11.200\), \(2\) Stamping printed name, timestamp, and) Tj
T* (legal intent \(§11.50\), \(3\) Immutable computer-generated audit trail tracking all edits and previous values) Tj
T* (\(§11.10e\), and \(4\) Strict segregation of duties.) Tj
