0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
201.2598425196850656 512.0014173228346408 Td
(We use pdfjs-dist with a dedicated web worker. The parser reads text glyphs along with their transform) Tj
T* (coordinates. It groups text items sharing identical or close vertical Y-coordinates into rows, sorts them horizontally) Tj
T* (by X-coordinate, strips header boilerplate, and dynamically maps tokens into standard pharma fields.) Tj
