(It features dual pathways: if the reviewer types feedback comments, the system forces a "Route BACK for) Tj
T* (Revision" loop back to the Author. If zero comments are entered, the system activates the "Direct Pass Rule",) Tj
T* (allowing the document to bypass revision and route straight to the Approver Dashboard.) Tj
